# Component tier sdkconfig defaults. Everything Portunus-specific comes from
# the production Kconfig defaults (main/Kconfig.projbuild, sourced by the
# test Kconfig); override a CONFIG_PORTUNUS_* symbol here only with a reason,
# and add it to the COMP-05 allowlist in the Taskfile.

# Target: linux (POSIX FreeRTOS simulator)
CONFIG_IDF_TARGET="linux"
